        <tr>
          <td class="docs">
            <p>Container hisoblagichlar map ini saqlaydi; biz uni bir
nechta goroutinadan parallel yangilamoqchi bo&rsquo;lganimiz uchun
kirishni sinxronlash maqsadida <code>Mutex</code> qo&rsquo;shamiz.
E&rsquo;tibor bering, mutexlar nusxalanmasligi kerak, shuning
uchun bu <code>struct</code> uzatilsa, u ko&rsquo;rsatkich orqali
bajarilishi kerak.</p>

          </td>
          <td class="code leading">
            
          <pre class="chroma"><code><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kd">type</span> <span class="nx">Container</span> <span class="kd">struct</span> <span class="p">{</span>
